Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.09,0:02:00.30,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}終わりが来たら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:02.55,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}なんて言おう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どうせなら　ほら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}哀しくない様に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:13.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}いつかのあなたの言葉が
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:16.27,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}酷く刺さってる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:22.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.33,0:02:32.96,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}知れば知るだけでいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:35.13,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何かを求めてしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:36.50,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:38.55,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どこにも行かないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:40.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どこにも行けないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:45.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}忘れないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:50.73,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何故か遠くなる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:57.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}瞳の裏にいつも君は居る
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:03:01.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}今も　ずっとそう
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:04.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}いつかね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:05.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}もう少しね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:09.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}世界に優しい風が吹いたら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何か変わるのでしょうか
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:16.29,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}「帰りたい場所がある」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:19.13,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}誰もがこの星の子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:20.59,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}約束はね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:22.01,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}大事にね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:26.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.09,0:02:00.30,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}倘若終結將降臨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:02.55,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}那該說些什麼才好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.68,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}倒不如像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.89,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}裝作不曾悲傷的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:13.77,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}往昔你說過的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:16.27,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}深深地刺痛著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:22.11,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}但溫暖猶存
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.33,0:02:32.96,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}明明知曉便已足夠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:35.13,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}卻總是渴求著更多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:36.50,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:38.55,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}我哪裡都不會去的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:40.63,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}其實我也無處可去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:45.26,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}分明從未遺忘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:50.73,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}卻為何漸行漸遠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:57.19,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}你始終存於我眼眸的深處
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:03:01.65,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}至今 一直如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:04.11,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:05.24,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}再稍等片刻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:09.54,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}如果世間吹起溫柔的風
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.62,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}是否會發生改變
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:16.29,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}「總有想要回去的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:19.13,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}人人都是這顆星球的子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:20.59,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}而約定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:22.01,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}可要好好珍惜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:26.39,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}溫暖猶存
