Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:21.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}So don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:26.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに知らないように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:31.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたを守れますように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.78,0:22:37.33,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}The story has only just begun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:40.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あてのない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:44.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}道なき道にいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:49.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}迷いながらいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:57.27,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望が　そこにあるよ　ともにあるよ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.48,0:22:59.98,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:02.36,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どこにいでも行ける羽を
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.02,0:23:04.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.78,0:23:06.28,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに授けたの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:13.24,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どんな闇も晴らしてしまえるように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:17.41,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}You gave me holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.41,0:23:22.00,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}恐れず進めよ　Oh holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:26.34,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}振り返ればいつも　Holy trace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:30.47,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたが笑ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.55,0:23:35.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}だから　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:40.10,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}躓きながらでも　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:44.48,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}私は踏み出せる　遠くへ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:49.03,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}あなたがいる場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:21.94,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以不要擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:26.49,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願不會被你察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:31.37,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願默默守護著你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.78,0:22:37.33,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}故事才剛剛拉開序幕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:40.08,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}縱使是在望不到盡頭的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:44.55,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}舉步維艱時也請相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:49.51,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}躊躇不定時也請相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:57.27,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望就在那裡 與我們相伴
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.48,0:22:59.98,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:02.36,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}將能飛向萬千世界的羽翼
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.02,0:23:04.61,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.78,0:23:06.28,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}授予你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:13.24,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願它能助你劃破一切黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:17.41,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}你賜予了我神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.41,0:23:22.00,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}讓我不懼一切地前行 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:26.34,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}每當回首都是條 光明之路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:30.47,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}都有你的笑容相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.55,0:23:35.60,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:40.10,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}即便是幾經坎坷 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:44.48,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}我都會邁向遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:49.03,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}向著有你在的方向
